  median |grad C|/|grad A| = 0.95
  penalty gradient at violation depth delta: 2*mu*delta*|grad C|;
    mu=   30, delta=0.005: penalty/physical gradient ratio ~ 0.28
    mu=   30, delta=0.020: penalty/physical gradient ratio ~ 1.14
    mu=  100, delta=0.005: penalty/physical gradient ratio ~ 0.95
    mu=  100, delta=0.020: penalty/physical gradient ratio ~ 3.79
    mu=  300, delta=0.005: penalty/physical gradient ratio ~ 2.84
    mu=  300, delta=0.020: penalty/physical gradient ratio ~ 11.37
  -> recommended mu = 30 (penalty ~ physical gradient at a 0.02 contrast violation; weak at 0.005, dominant only for deep violations)
